    "question": "Given that $\\log_{2} 3 = k$, express $\\log_{3} 8$ in terms of $k$.",
    "question_zh": "已知 $\\log_{2} 3 = k$，試以 $k$ 表示 $\\log_{3} 8$。",
    "answer": "\\frac{3}{k}",
    "correct_answer": "\\frac{3}{k}",
    "solution_steps": [
      "By Change of Base formula: $\\log_{3} 8 = \\frac{\\log_{2} 8}{\\log_{2} 3}$.",
      "Since $8 = 2^3$, $\\log_{2} 8 = 3$.",
      "Given $\\log_{2} 3 = k$, we have $\\log_{3} 8 = \\frac{3}{k}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "利用換底公式：$\\log_{3} 8 = \\frac{\\log_{2} 8}{\\log_{2} 3}$。",
      "由於 $8 = 2^3$，因此 $\\log_{2} 8 = 3$。",
      "已知 $\\log_{2} 3 = k$，故 $\\log_{3} 8 = \\frac{3}{k}$。"
    ]
  },
