    "question": "Solve $\\log_{10} (x) + \\log_{10} (x-3) = 1$.",
    "question_zh": "解方程 $\\log_{10} (x) + \\log_{10} (x-3) = 1$。",
    "answer": "10",
    "correct_answer": "10",
    "solution_steps": [
      "Combine logarithms: $\\log_{10} [(x)(x-3)] = 1$.",
      "Convert to exponential form: $(x)(x-3) = 10^{1} = 10$.",
      "Expanding: $x^2-3x-10=0$",
      "Factoring: $(x-5)(x+2)=0$",
      "Checking validity ($f(x)>0$), we reject negative roots.",
      "Solution is $x = 5$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "合併對數：$\\log_{10} [(x)(x-3)] = 1$。",
      "化為指數形式：$(x)(x-3) = 10^{1} = 10$。",
      "展開：$x^2-3x-10=0$",
      "因式分解：$(x-5)(x+2)=0$",
      "檢查有效性（真數必須大於 0），捨去負根。",
      "解為 $x = 5$。"
    ]
  },
