    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設 $u = 2^x$。則 $u^2 - 5u + 4 = 0$。",
      "經因式分解，$(u - 4)(u - 1) = 0$。",
      "因此，$u = 4$ 或 $u = 1$。",
      "代回：$2^x = 4 \\Rightarrow x = 2$ 或 $2^x = 1 \\Rightarrow x = 0$。"
    ]
